W quad_double_numbers%s	quad_double_numbers.adb	quad_double_numbers.ali
W quaddobl_complex_numbers%s  quaddobl_complex_numbers.ads  quaddobl_complex_numbers.ali
W quaddobl_complex_vector_norms%s  quaddobl_complex_vector_norms.adb  quaddobl_complex_vector_norms.ali
